# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored.

# Google Maps JavaScript API key, used by src/app/components/GoogleMapView.tsx.
# NOTE: this is a *browser* key — Vite inlines it into the production bundle, so
# it is readable by anyone who views the deployed site. It cannot be kept secret.
# Protect it with an HTTP-referrer restriction in Google Cloud Console instead:
#   Credentials -> the key -> Application restrictions -> Websites
#   Allowed referrers: https://www.proxypaw.com/*, https://proxypaw.com/*
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=""
